{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16d5_level_act16d5_st02",
  "groupId": "act16d5",
  "stageId": "act16d5_st02",
  "title": "一日之禍",
  "storyCode": "WR-ST-2",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16d5/level_act16d5_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "67dc7c50568e782a5f64a81f5e11cacecf3b792f3a65fb51b79a2c8477aa469e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "往這！往這邊來點，對！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_140",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，你幫我把那門釘上，拿穩了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有沒有人看見我們家老三，有沒有人看見我們家老三呐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你、你有沒有看見我們家的老三？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "抱歉，小僧未曾見過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "村民",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_141",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "小余，小余，你在哪兒啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#3",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "欸，叔叔給你買糖吃，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "叔叔帶你看煙火？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......你媽媽要是在，也不會想看到小阿然不吃不喝的，對不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......媽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_142",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "媽媽......媽媽啊啊啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唉，哭吧，哭出來，總比悶在心裡要好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "烏有，這孩子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人......這孩子叫阿然，聽說她父親早早離鄉尋工，再也沒回來。昨天的事，又不見了母親，一直恍恍惚惚的，到了今天也不吃不喝呀......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人！恩人呐，您可別擺出那副臉色，要不是您和克洛絲二位，這鎮上，還不得生靈塗炭啊，俗話說得好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......唉，俗話哪管用呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人，我們現在該怎麼辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "......找到黎和那個說書的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "speakerToken": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "portraitKey": "char_1011_purgatory",
      "text": "他們明顯知道些什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嚯......稀客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你認得我了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "婥園之主，煮傘先生，這婆山鎮，誰人不知？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "您這位說書先生，繼承了那位大商的園子，可不就是婆山鎮的老天爺嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "先生請坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......免了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這就要走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今日先生倒真是沉默......不過，請先留步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "平時都是您給大家說書解悶，只收些象徵性的茶水錢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不如今天，讓我來給先生說段故事，而且不收茶錢，白送這碗茶水。不知先生意下如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今天要講的故事，可比先生搜羅來的那些志怪小說，要簡單得多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "話說數十年前，大炎東南邊陲，有一處名叫婆山鎮的鎮子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不，你繼續吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這座婆山鎮，平平無奇。鎮上不過百來戶人家，靠山吃山，日子過得樸實。偶爾會有商隊路過，那個日子，就是孩子們狂歡的日子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而就是這樣一個小鎮，卻在某一日，遭遇了天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "天災沒有徹底毀了這座小鎮，但活性源石污染了水源。大人們想向附近的城邦求援，但鎮上沒有信使，離開鎮子的大人，又全部杳無音訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "於是，被迫無奈地，人們拋棄了這座城鎮，開始了漫無目的的旅途——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "鎮上其實沒人知道該去哪裡，他們甚至對最近的城市都一無所知，就像聽天由命一樣，他們選了一個方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "對於那些孩子而言，溫暖的床榻，曲折的籬笆，牆上風趣的水漬，突然就全部變成了伸手不見五指的夜晚，還有一條......很長的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這條路上，餓死了很多人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有個孩子，她年歲不大，家境貧寒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她跟著她的父母走著，看著那些親密無間的鄰里變得少言寡語。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看著那些一起玩耍的哥哥姐姐，為了半塊發黴的燒餅，就用尖銳的石子互相毆打。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她想，也許事情會好起來的。她也努力了，去找漿果，找小動物，去抓河裡的鱗獸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她還險些因為抓鱗獸而溺死在河裡，也幾次因為饑餓而失去意識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許只是造化弄人，也許她身邊的至親突然意識到，這個瘦削的小丫頭最後的用處，就是為他們省下一些口糧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當她捧著不知能不能入口的山果回“家”時，那裡已經空無一人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "寒夜峭壁間的獸鳴提醒了她，她的生命一文不值。她在恍惚間仿佛天人感應一般，每寸肌膚都在向她描繪死亡的溫度，然後——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#5",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她見到了一個人。一個......奇妙的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那話怎麼說來著？哦......欲知後事如何，且聽下回分解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黎",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_139#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總是在這個時候吊人胃口，真是壞心眼，先生難得像普通人一樣嘗嘗這滋味，感覺如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#1",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "哦，掌櫃的，小僧找你好久啦——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#1",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "——唔？先生何故在此？方才一場大難，大夥可都在擔心你啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒什麼......只是在這裡走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嵯峨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#1",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "嗯？小僧在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在畫中久矣，點到為止，差不多得了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#1",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你何苦也費力去撈水中月？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "眾人皆醉，你獨醒，卻還要裝醉，反而很不討喜了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嵯峨",
      "speakerToken": "char_362_Saga#2",
      "operatorId": "char_362_Saga",
      "portraitKey": "char_362_Saga",
      "text": "您不是那說書先生......您就是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "說書人",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_138#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好自為之罷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯的扇子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "哎呀，這不是克洛絲恩人嗎，怎麼突然闖進來了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "唉，這次大傢伙都遭了殃啦，沒事，我會和兩位恩人一起幫忙重建園子的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......烏有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也許你真的只是一個普通的信使，不過我還是得提醒你一句......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "現在這個情況，如果你仍然要堅持互相保留......我們也只好放棄對你的信任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......恩人呐！你在說什麼呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不錯的扇子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......您看見了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "炎國功夫各式各樣，雖然我不是專家，不過你身手不差......相當不差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "想必你隱藏身手肯定是有自己的苦衷吧，這個我不打算刨根問底就是啦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......但是我並不喜歡明明有能力出手相助，卻要給自己找藉口畏首畏尾的行為哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#4",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嚴格說來，這很自私吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欸，雖然話說得很重，不過你還是有救下阿然的嘛，不用太愧疚啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "抱歉，恩人。二位救了我，我理當全盤托出才是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人原來......早就看穿了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "當然啦，只是看你裝模作樣還挺有趣的而已嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "啊哈哈......等從這裡逃出去，我會給二位恩人一個交代的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#1",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那說好了喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "恩人......我在想一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛絲",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_144#3",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "我在想，在這園子裡恍然大悟前，我們到底在這座不尋常的鎮子上......困了多久？完全沒印象......也就是說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烏有",
      "speakerToken": "char_455_nothing_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_455_nothing",
      "portraitKey": "char_455_nothing",
      "text": "離我們在那灰齊山上推門而入，到底過了多久？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
